      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 12,
      "original_position": 4,
      "content": "Now I have a clear picture. **222.png** is a dark-themed design with navy background, gold/amber accents, decorative stars, and a sleek circular diagram. Let me recreate **111.png**'s content (the AI learning wheel with 8 segments) in that style, with the updated title."
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_299aa1b64659:msg_28",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 5385,
      "source_file": "messages",
